#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1083
msgid "Allow exceeding max height"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1084
msgid ""
"By default, G-code export is blocked when any generated Z movement, including Z offset, Z-hop or "
"lift, and custom G-code, exceeds Max print height. Enable this option to allow such G-code to be "
"exported. This does not allow models taller than Max print height and does not change the "
"printer's physical limits. Enable it only if the printer can safely execute movements beyond the "
"configured maximum height."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:1091
msgid "Hostname, IP or URL"
