#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2816
msgid "Shrinkage compensation XY"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2817
msgid ""
"Enter your material shrinkage percentages for the X and Y axes here to apply scaling of the "
"object to compensate for shrinkage in the X and Y axes. For example, if you measured 99mm instead "
"of 100mm, enter 1%."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2827
msgid "Shrinkage compensation Z"
msgstr ""

