"Set zero to disable acceleration control for first layer of object above raft interface."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3219
msgid "First layer bed temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3220
msgid ""
"Heated build plate temperature for the first layer. Set this to zero to disable bed temperature "
"control commands in the output."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3230
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for first layer. You can use this to "
"force fatter extrudates for better adhesion. If expressed as percentage (for example 120%) it "
"will be computed over the selected calculation base. If set to zero, it will use the default "
"extrusion width."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3244
msgid ""
"Base for percentage-based first layer extrusion width calculation. Used only for percentage "
"values."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3256
msgid ""
"When printing with very low layer heights, you might still want to print a thicker bottom layer "
"to improve adhesion and tolerance for non perfect build plates."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3264
msgid "First layer height (%)"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3266
msgid ""
"Percentage of the T0 nozzle diameter used to derive First layer height in mm. Changing this value "
"or nozzle diameter updates First layer height."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3274
msgid "First layer speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3275
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to all the print moves of the "
"first layer, regardless of their type. If expressed as a percentage (for example: 40%) it will "
"scale the default speeds."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3285
msgid "First layer solid infill speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3286
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to the solid infill print "
"moves of the first layer. If expressed as a percentage (for example: 40%) it will be a percantage "
"of the solid infill speed (for example: 40% of the solid infill speed). Note that 0 means that "
"the \"First layer speed\" value will be used."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3297
msgid "Speed of object first layer over raft interface"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3298
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to all the print moves of the "
"first object layer above raft interface, regardless of their type. If expressed as a percentage "
"(for example: 40%) it will scale the default speeds."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3308
msgid "First layer nozzle temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3309
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature for the first layer. If you want to control temperature manually during print, "
"set this to zero to disable temperature control commands in the output G-code."
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3317
msgid "Full fan speed at layer"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:3318
msgid ""
"Fan speed will be ramped up linearly from zero at layer \"disable_fan_first_layers\" to maximum "
"at layer \"full_fan_speed_layer\". \"full_fan_speed_layer\" will be ignored if lower than "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\", in which case the fan will be running at maximum allowed speed at "
"layer \"disable_fan_first_layers\" + 1."
msgstr ""

