msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4833
msgid "Seam type"
msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:4835
msgid ""
"Controls the shape of the external perimeter at the seam. Nip/Tuck creates a V-shaped notch on "
"both sides, Nip on the start side, and Tuck on the end side. Alt. Nip/Tuck alternates Nip and "
"Tuck between layers."
