msgstr ""

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:5136
msgid ""
"When enabled, supported nozzle, bed and chamber temperature commands in generated and custom G-"
"code are rounded to whole numbers during export. This includes firmware-specific commands and "
"preview slider entries. Klipper always enforces integer temperatures. The original custom G-code "
"and slider entries remain unchanged."
